					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Hereby declare]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="30" y="194" width="502" height="24" uuid="bb450719-f56e-4fdc-b0d8-d074d6705422">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Telah melihat dan menyetujui pola tarif yang berlaku di Rumah Sakit Windu Husada, (Tarif Rawat Inap, Tarif Penunjang Medis, Tarif Tindakan Medis dan Therapi) :]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="30" y="218" width="502" height="24" uuid="4d76fbf6-c07e-4c93-b4d9-3de726a3d135">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Have seen and approved the tariff pattern that applies in Windu Husada Hospital, (Inpatient Rates, Medical Support Rates, Medical Procedure and Therapeutic Action Rates) :]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="50" y="242" width="482" height="24" uuid="488c6136-6951-4081-bd0d-54b4251136cc">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Apabila pasien pindah kelas ke kelas perawatan yang lebih tinggi setelah mendapatkan tindakan operatif. Maka tarif tindakan operatif yang dilakukan sesuai tarif kelas perawatan yang lebih tinggi (kelas perawatan tertinggi)]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="35" y="242" width="15" height="24" uuid="b59b6ea5-a64e-4fc9-9f9e-3d11db6b34c9">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[1.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="50" y="266" width="482" height="24" uuid="0da8bc50-23e0-4876-9330-2f16ddb8ac7f">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[If patient decides to upgrade for a higher class of treatment after the surgery being performed, then the rate of surgery applied following the higher class.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement x="50" y="314" width="482" height="24" uuid="76246e04-013a-4a24-bb36-302d369fbf69">
