					<font fontName="Tahoma" size="9" isItalic="true"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="Single"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Requesting a consultation regarding the illness to another physician who has Permit Practice (SIP) both inside and outside the Hospital.]]></text>
